        <mxCell id="gC91FWv8XmuCjonAxezc-39" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); line-height: 140%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;CloudFront edge servers route and optimise delivery based on request type. Static asset requests are fetched from the relevant &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;S3 origin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, while API calls matching &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;/api/*&lt;/span&gt; are forwarded to &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API Gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. CloudFront ensures low latency through global caching and applies the &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS WAF rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; before any origin is reached, protecting both static content and backend APIs.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;shadow=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Tahoma;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="935" y="440" width="695" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gC91FWv8XmuCjonAxezc-41" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); line-height: 140%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Tahoma&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Backend services process and respond to application requests. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;S3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; origins store and deliver static portfolio and Chapter 3 content securely via &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origin Access Control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API Gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; invokes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lambda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; functions to validate and process form submissions, triggering &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;SES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; for emails or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;SNS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; for notifications. Operational visibility is maintained with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudWatch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; logs, metrics, and alarms, ensuring reliability and quick issue detection.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;shadow=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Tahoma;textShadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="935" y="720" width="695" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gC91FWv8XmuCjonAxezc-43" value="&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Tahoma&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Security is enforced at multiple layers: &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS WAF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; filters malicious traffic before it reaches any origin, &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; enforces HTTPS with TLS, and &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origin Access Control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; restricts S3 bucket access to the distribution only. Personal Identifiable Information (PII) is not stored — form submissions are validated in &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lambda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and securely forwarded via &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;SES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;SNS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, with no persistence in databases or logs beyond what is required for operational monitoring in &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudWatch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. This approach ensures compliance with data protection principles and minimises risk.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#E2E2E2;shadow=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Tahoma;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="935" y="950" width="695" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gC91FWv8XmuCjonAxezc-44" value="Portfolio&lt;div&gt;Page&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Request&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=default;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="510" width="80" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gC91FWv8XmuCjonAxezc-45" value="Chapter 3&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Page&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Request&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=default;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="330" y="512.5" width="80" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gC91FWv8XmuCjonAxezc-46" value="Form&lt;div&gt;Submission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Request&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=default;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="370" width="80" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gC91FWv8XmuCjonAxezc-47" value="Lambda&lt;div&gt;Invocation&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=default;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="650" width="80" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eQMDpSa7VK1TG6nrKqV0-17" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Chapter 3: Secure Contact Form&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;A secure, serverless AWS architecture delivering static content via CloudFront and processing contact form submissions through API Gateway and Lambda, with multi-layered security and zero PII storage.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=top;aspect=fixed;textDirection=ltr;horizontal=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="70" width="700" height="44.21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KZZHblNO4dGuXK7UTbdg-1" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); line-height: 140%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Tahoma&quot;&gt;The Public Zone is the entry point for all user traffic. Requests for the site’s domain (&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;christianhegarty.com&lt;/span&gt;) are resolved via &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Route 53&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; DNS. Incoming traffic is inspected by &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS WAF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; at the edge to block malicious requests such as bots, SQL injection, and DoS attacks. Clean traffic is routed into &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, which serves static content from S3 or forwards API calls to the backend.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;shadow=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Tahoma;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="920" y="160" width="585" height="155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
